id: nd-dmr/wells
title: North Dakota oil and gas wells (OGD_Wells, DMR public GIS) and the well data subscription
summary: >-
  The Oil and Gas Division's well layer "Contains Lat/Long data and footage descriptions (legal
  description), as well as operator information, type/status, NDIC File number and other oil and gas
  related information." Scout tickets (log tops, completions, tests, production, DST recoveries, core
  photographs), well files and "More than 100,600 digital and image logs ... for over 18,650 wells"
  are sold by subscription.
publisher: {name: "North Dakota Industrial Commission, Department of Mineral Resources, Oil and Gas Division", url: https://www.dmr.nd.gov/oilgas/, country: US}
origin:
  url: https://www.dmr.nd.gov/oilgas/subscriptionservice.asp
  access: purchase
  manifest_url: https://gis.dmr.nd.gov/dmrpublicservices/rest/services/Wells/FeatureServer/0?f=json
  notes: "The well layer is free (44,018 features on 23 Oct 2026, 2000 per query); the subscription covers the well index, scout tickets, well files and logs. The same GIS server has Seismic3D, Seismic2D, Directional_Well_Bore and Horizontal_Well_Bore services."
licence:
  name: Legal Disclaimer (NDIC Oil and Gas Division)
  spdx: null
  url: https://www.dmr.nd.gov/oilgas/disclaimer.asp
  redistribution: unknown
  attribution: unknown
  terms:
    stated: "As of January 1, 2026, our Basic Subscription rate is $100/year and our Premium Subscription rate is $500/year."
kinds: [wellbore-headers, tops, wellbore-logs, core, pressure, production, reports]
region: {country: US, basin: Williston Basin (North Dakota), bbox: [-104.05, 45.93, -96.55, 49.0]}
listed_by: [publisher]
known_issues:
  - "Only the well locations and headers are free; the other kinds are subscription products."
  - "The disclaimer disowns accuracy and states no licence."
  - "bbox is the State of North Dakota, approximate."
