    64	   URL without a query, `format: arcgis`, `crs` and `stated` from the service description), and
    65	   `period` for the six without one where the register's page or service description states its
    66	   coverage (E16 design 2; the publisher's sentence in `notes`); a register that states none keeps
    67	   no period and no Items, said in the PR. Outlines for these records are generated with
    68	   `--outlines`, reviewed, committed under `outlines/`, then verified with `--outline-inputs`.
    69	6. Site: nothing new; tiles (E15) carry the points. One phone-width screenshot of a new register
    70	   is evidence.
