    34	## The gate
    35	
    36	`make check` = ruff + pytest + schema validation + build, offline. It is the only required
    37	status. Network verification (`verify` workflow) comments on pull requests and never blocks: a
    38	publisher's outage is a finding, not a red gate. The site publishes from main on every merge.
    39	
    40	## Proof bar by class
    41	
    42	- **Kernel** (schemas, verifier, build, manifest, bridge): tests for every acceptance line, a
    43	  mutation shown to fail for every guard, one Codex round on the charter. Strategy at lane open,
    44	  at most two pages.
    45	- **Surface** (site, docs, records): `make check` green and a screenshot or the verify comment.
    46	  No strategy document; the charter's acceptance list is the brief.
    47	- **Records**: the verify comment shows the level; a human checks the licence fields against
    48	  the publisher's page. Same-day merge.
